    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Games</strong> is a fun and fast-paced cartoon sports game where adorable animal athletes compete in exciting challenges! Choose from a variety of lovable creatures, each with the same balanced skills, and dive into action-packed matches across <strong>10 unique maps</strong>. Every location features its own  exclusive soundtrack, making every game feel fresh and exciting. Whether you're playing solo or challenging friends, <strong>Animal Games</strong> delivers nonstop fun with charming visuals, energetic music, and easy-to-learn gameplay. Get ready to jump, dash, and score your way to victory in the ultimate animal sports showdown!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Games</strong> is a fun and fast-paced cartoon sports game where adorable animal athletes compete in exciting challenges! Choose from a variety of lovable creatures, each with the same balanced skills, and dive into action-packed matches across <strong>10 unique maps</strong>. Every location features its own  exclusive soundtrack, making every game feel fresh and exciting. Whether you're playing solo or challenging friends, <strong>Animal Games</strong> delivers nonstop fun with charming visuals, energetic music, and easy-to-learn gameplay. Get ready to jump, dash, and score your way to victory in the ultimate animal sports showdown!</p>",
    "short_description": "Animal Games is a fast-paced cartoon sports game where cute animal athletes compete across 10 unique maps, each with its own music, for nonstop fun and excitement!",
